{'symbol': 'ETSY', 'date': '2023-02-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'ETSY APPOINTS COLIN STRETCH AS CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER AND CORPORATE SECRETARY', 'text': 'BROOKLYN, N.Y. , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ETSY, INC. (NASDAQ: ETSY), WHICH OPERATES TWO-SIDED ONLINE MARKETPLACES THAT CONNECT MILLIONS OF PASSIONATE AND CREATIVE BUYERS AND SELLERS AROUND THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT COLIN STRETCH WILL JOIN THE COMPANY AS CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER AND CORPORATE SECRETARY, EFFECTIVE ON FEBRUARY 14, 2023.'}